// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's main page is now /auditors-office (/county-auditor is the
//     "Meet the Auditor" page).
//   * The health department has its own site, harrisonpublichealth.org.
//   * OhioMeansJobs is listed through the Area 16 site (omj16.com) instead of the
//     generic state page.
//   * MWCD's Tappan Lake page moved to mwcd.org/places/tappan-lake/.
//   * The reaweb property search (bare-IP HTTP addresses) did not load in a
//     browser or fetch; the July vendor label is kept but is unverified.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Harrison County WV/KY/IN/TX/MS/IA/MO; Cadiz KY; Hopedale IL; Jewett TX;
//   harrisontownshipohio.com (Hamilton County); harrisoncountychamber.com (WV).
//   harrisonhistory.org now redirects to adware and is excluded.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cadiz is the seat. Villages with sites: Cadiz, Scio and Bowerston.
//   * One school district (Harrison Hills); Puskarich Public Library in Cadiz.
//   * Part of the Carroll-Columbiana-Harrison solid waste district and OMJ Area 16.
//     Tappan, Clendening and Piedmont lakes (MWCD) are major recreation sites.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Deersville, Freeport, Hopedale, Jewett, New Athens and Harrisville villages
//     and the townships: no websites found.
//   * Chamber of commerce, United Way, humane society, Board of DD, land bank and
//     the solid waste district: no websites found.
//   * Bowerston Public Library and the Clark Gable Foundation sites do not load.

